OL,3,GNEWSAScottish drivers hit as diesel
OL,4,Apasses #2 a litre across the country
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe price of diesel has exceeded #2 a
OL,7,Flitre at hundreds of Scottish
OL,8,Fforecourts, according to analysis by
OL,9,FBBC Scotland News.
OL,11,FSome of the highest prices can be found
OL,12,Fat garages in Scotland's islands, where
OL,13,Ffuel is 50p a litre more expensive than
OL,14,Fthat sold at supermarkets in the
OL,15,Fcentral belt.
OL,17,FHauliers have described the cost to
OL,18,Ftheir businesses as "devastating" and
OL,19,Fsay it now costs #250 a week more to
OL,20,Ffill up a lorry.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
