OL,3,GNEWSAScottish drivers hit as diesel
OL,4,Apasses #2 a litre across the country
OL,5,
OL,6,FMotoring organisation the RAC said it
OL,7,Fexpected the UK average price of diesel
OL,8,Fto hit a new record high over the
OL,9,Fweekend.
